1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
东北凉菜之王，竟是土豆做的
Northeast's king of cold dishes — from potato

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
土豆淀粉，调成稀浆
Potato starch, mixed into a thin slurry

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
舀进"旋子"，坐上滚水
Ladled into a "xuanzi" on boiling water

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
一转一晃，凝成透明皮
Spun and swirled into a clear sheet

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
过遍冰水，切成宽带
Ice-bathed, then cut into broad ribbons

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
黄瓜丝、胡萝卜、木耳
Cucumber, carrot, wood-ear strips

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
灵魂：麻酱加蒜泥
The soul — sesame paste and mashed garlic

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
再来勺油泼辣子、香醋
Then chili oil and a splash of vinegar

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,700
拌一拌，爽滑不埋汰
Toss it — slick and clean, never "máitai"

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,000
夏天整这么一盘，贼开胃
A summer plate that really "zhěng" wakes you up

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,500
凉皮·冷面·凉粉·大拉皮，你站哪碗？
Liangpi, cold noodles, liangfen or lapi?

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,000
你家拌拉皮，放不放麻酱？评论区见
Sesame paste on lapi — yes or no? Tell us
